{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Getting Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout"],"anchor":"Getting-Started","generated":true}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrating Mollie Components is three steps: add the package, present the sheet from your checkout screen with a server-issued client access token, and switch over the typed "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"type":"text","text":" you get back. Card data the cardholder types stays inside Mollie’s UI and is tokenized over TLS — your code only ever sees session metadata."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires iOS 16.0+, Swift 5.9+, and Xcode 16+. It is distributed exclusively via Swift Package Manager.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/mollie\/mollie-components-ios\", from: \"0.1.0\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Or in Xcode: "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File → Add Package Dependencies…","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", then paste the repository URL."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Merchants import only the umbrella module:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MollieComponents"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the only library the package exposes — the entire merchant surface is reachable through it alone.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Build a checkout","anchor":"Build-a-checkout","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout"},{"type":"text","text":" owns the session context for a client access token. The SDK never presents its own sheet — you own presentation, either by pushing the card form modally from a "},{"code":"UIViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or by embedding "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" in your own SwiftUI layout (including your own "},{"code":".sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", if you want a modal)."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MollieComponents","","let checkout = try MollieCheckout(clientToken: clientToken)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construction decodes the token eagerly and throws if it’s malformed, so you can fail fast before presenting anything."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Present modally (UIKit)","anchor":"Present-modally-UIKit","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentCard(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with the host view controller and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":" the terminal outcome:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let result = await checkout.presentCard(from: viewController)","","switch result {","case .completed(let payment):","    \/\/ Success — reconcile against your backend using payment.sessionToken","    break","case .failed(let error):","    \/\/ Map the error to merchant-facing UI — see <doc:HandlingErrors>","    break","case .cancelled:","    \/\/ The cardholder dismissed the sheet — not an error","    break","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sheet always renders with Mollie’s branded appearance — see "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Present inline (SwiftUI)","anchor":"Present-inline-SwiftUI","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Vend the embeddable form with ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and place it in your own layout — including your own ","type":"text"},{"code":".sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", if you want a modal:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MollieComponents","import SwiftUI","","struct CheckoutScreen: View {","    @State private var isPaying = false","    let clientToken: String","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Pay\") { isPaying = true }","            .sheet(isPresented: $isPaying) {","                if let checkout = try? MollieCheckout(clientToken: clientToken) {","                    checkout.makeCardComponent { result in","                        switch result {","                        case .completed(let payment): break","                        case .failed(let error): break","                        case .cancelled: break","                        }","                        isPaying = false","                    }","                }","            }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or embed the card form directly in your layout with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — no modal, the form’s own “Pay with card” button is the call to action:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["checkout.makeCardComponent { result in","    \/\/ Same MolliePaymentResult, fired exactly once","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Handle the result","anchor":"Handle-the-result","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entry point resolves to the same "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken"},{"type":"text","text":" you use to reconcile server-side."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" carries the failure. Map it to your own localized UI — the full catalog of causes and recommended actions is in "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" means the cardholder dismissed the flow. This is a normal terminal state, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" an error."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identif